entries[278330] = { ["name"] = "Schematic: R0CKY", ["text"] = "Binds to Warband\nUse: Teaches you how to craft R0CKY.\n\nPermanently attaches an mechanical compression array to a helmet, allowing you to deploy R0CKY and fall slowly for 2 min. The glider has some initial thrust and allows you to turn while falling.\n\nThe helmet can only be used once every three minutes and requires a Midnight Engineering skill of at least 1 to operate.\nRequires Midnight Engineering (35)" }
